{"chapter-slug":"rw8-08 J","paragraph":627,"wording":"[Senator]","event":"named","holder-slug":"lyfelt","claimed":true,"claimed-by-slug":"Nomna","holder-quote":"“If he wants to be a [Royal Advisor]—do I think he would sell out Jecrass? No. But Lyfelt is ambitious. He would never settle to be a [Senator] when he could be a [Prime Minister]. He probably thinks you’re his last avenue to safety and power after what happened. I don’t think he’d ever betray you. He was Raelt’s friend. He can be ruthless, but he doesn’t betray. Or so I thought. After I saw those Gnolls…I don’t know.”","id":"2c9d4274-7ed2-5432-94f0-a5af8e10ba68"}
